title: "KTAS triage prediction with small language models: Source code"
abstract: >-
  Stage-specific LoRA fine-tuning, constrained candidate-scoring inference, and standalone evaluation with bootstrap confidence intervals for hierarchical Korean Triage and Acuity Scale (KTAS) prediction. No study data are included.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-12"
license: BSD-2-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/doammii/ktas-slm-triage"
keywords:
  - triage
  - Korean Triage and Acuity Scale
  - small language model
  - low-rank adaptation
  - clinical decision support
